{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skin of Rana -\u00a0Oborobana</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625140/extras/lana.jpg?t=1744683092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the skin of Rana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the homeland of the swordsman-in-scarlet, whispers bespoke a kitsune spirit. In an era wracked by the wails of the downtrodden, amidst the revelry of debauched ministers, there would slip in a bewitching dancer - with enchanting silken eyes and steps like petals on the wind, she knew well how to ensnare the heart of the lord upon the high seat, luring him into a trance before striking him down in a paroxysm of violence. And before the feast of horror could dissolve into chaos, she would make her egress with the same phantom grace, leaving only a trail of blood and vixen tresses of the same red. Even now, there are faithful among common folk, who raise shrines and offer worship to the kitsune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625140?t=1744683092","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625140?t=1744683092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625140/0bb910c650a27aaac67b7272d0f37830bffb3c07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744683092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625140/0bb910c650a27aaac67b7272d0f37830bffb3c07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744683092","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content